Package: PriorPostPlots
Title: Prior-posterior plots for Stan models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Shane", family = "Richards", email = "shane.richards@utas.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9638-5827"))
Description: Generates a ggplot comparing prior and posterior distributions by combining sampling output from a Stan model with a data frame specifying the prior distributions for selected model parameters.
